proxy_unreachable.description:
Home Assistant cannot find a Bluetooth proxy advertising the mesh network "{network}" (expected Network ID {network_id}). A mesh node offers a single proxy connection slot: if the Häfele Connect Mesh app (or another client) is connected to a lamp, it holds that slot and Home Assistant is locked out. Close the app and free the lamp, and make sure at least one lamp is powered and in range of a Bluetooth proxy.

Diagnostics — mesh proxy adverts Home Assistant currently sees: {seen}

Home Assistant keeps retrying and clears this issue automatically once a proxy is reachable.
